OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to former Bay City
OL,4,ARollers guitarist Neil Henderson
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to former Bay
OL,7,FCity Rollers guitarist Neil Henderson,
OL,8,Fwho has died at the age of 73.
OL,10,FHenderson was in the pop rock band from
OL,11,F1970-72 and performed on their debut
OL,12,Fchart single Keep on Dancing, but left
OL,13,Fshortly before Rollermania propelled
OL,14,Fthem to worldwide fame.
OL,16,FHe went on to join another successful
OL,17,FScottish band, Middle of the Road,
OL,18,Fwhich had a number one hit a few years
OL,19,Fearlier with Chirpy Chirpy Cheep Cheep.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
