OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to former Bay City
OL,4,ARollers guitarist Neil Henderson
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis former Middle of the Road bandmates
OL,7,Fsaid his memory would live on through
OL,8,Fhis music and with all those who had
OL,9,Fshared a stage with him.
